{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 62,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.31009674072266,
        57.98431396484375,
        387.2331848144531,
        84.36231231689453
      ],
      "text": "7. Evidence for recommendations",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 22.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        109.73789978027344,
        79.98431396484375,
        343.79595947265625,
        106.36231231689453
      ],
      "text": "for treatment of dysentery",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 22.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.5670166015625,
        260.8419189453125,
        203.75601196289062
      ],
      "text": "7.1\t Antibiotics for treatment of dysentery",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        207.19261169433594,
        399.13275146484375,
        220.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "a)\t Children with diarrhoea and blood in stool (i.e. dysentery) should be treated with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        220.19261169433594,
        399.05157470703125,
        233.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "ciprofloxacin as a first line treatment. Ceftriaxone should be given as a second",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        233.19261169433594,
        399.1014404296875,
        246.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "line treatment in severely ill children where local antimicrobial sensitivity is not",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        246.19261169433594,
        98.70149230957031,
        259.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "known.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        259.1925964355469,
        289.5515441894531,
        272.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "—\t Ciprofloxacin: 15 mg/kg/dose twice daily for 3 days",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        272.1925964355469,
        252.38157653808594,
        285.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "—\t Ceftriaxone: 50–80 mg/kg daily for 3 days",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        287.5972900390625,
        252.91282653808594,
        301.5173034667969
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        303.86187744140625,
        399.04278564453125,
        317.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "b)\tWhere local antimicrobial sensitivity is known, local guidelines should be",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        316.86187744140625,
        104.99148559570312,
        330.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "followed.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        332.2665100097656,
        252.91282653808594,
        346.1865234375
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        348.53118896484375,
        399.0627136230469,
        362.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "The panel noted that the evidence of impact of antibiotics comes from epidemics in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        361.53118896484375,
        399.062744140625,
        375.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "the 1970s where different antibiotics were used with widely varying case fatality rates,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        374.53118896484375,
        399.02288818359375,
        388.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "and only one randomized control trail. It was also noted that although the evidence",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        387.53118896484375,
        399.0427551269531,
        401.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "from RCTs is specifically for management of Shigella dysentery, the guidelines refer",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        400.53118896484375,
        392.7728271484375,
        414.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "to bloody diarrhoea as in most cases there will be no prior testing before treatment.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        413.53118896484375,
        399.08148193359375,
        427.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "The increasingly widespread antibiotic resistance to ampicillin, co-trimoxazole,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        426.53118896484375,
        399.0927429199219,
        440.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "chloramphenicol, nalidixic acid, tetracycline, gentamicin, and 1st and 2nd generation",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        439.53118896484375,
        399.1328430175781,
        453.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "cephalosporin make them less effective for treatment. There is also reported resistance",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        452.53118896484375,
        377.58294677734375,
        466.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "to ciprofloxacin, and hence the need for continued drug resistance surveillance.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        477.0498046875,
        231.48292541503906,
        489.039794921875
      ],
      "text": "7.1.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        492.70440673828125,
        399.0728759765625,
        506.1944274902344
      ],
      "text": "There was low quality evidence from two systematic reviews, a recently updated",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        140.193603515625,
        505.48443603515625,
        250.24362182617188,
        519.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.14",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        505.70440673828125,
        399.0966491699219,
        519.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "Cochrane review ( ) and a WHO Children Health",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        518.7044067382812,
        399.1228332519531,
        532.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "Epidemiology Reference Group (CHERG) review that most of the antibiotics used",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        531.7044067382812,
        399.0827941894531,
        545.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "were effective depending on antimicrobial sensitivity patterns [Christopher, 2010;",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        544.7044067382812,
        399.052978515625,
        558.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "Traa, 2010]. The reviews confirm the current WHO recommendations and current",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        557.7044067382812,
        399.11279296875,
        571.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "practice as it is not possible to recommend a specific antibiotic or antibiotic group",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        570.7044067382812,
        398.55279541015625,
        584.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "that would be universally effective due to wide variation in antimicrobial sensitivity.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        583.7044067382812,
        399.0614318847656,
        597.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "The Cochrane review included all RCTs comparing the efficacy of one antibiotic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        596.7044067382812,
        399.10272216796875,
        610.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "to placebo, or comparing the efficacy of various antibiotics, in children as well as",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        609.7044067382812,
        399.0927734375,
        623.1943969726562
      ],
      "text": "in adults. Many of the RCTs included in this systematic review were conducted",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.36289978027344,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.6789093017578,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "48",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}